  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health and Rights for women, Adolescent girls and Children (SRHR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">O1.1.2.1: The increased equitable use of sexual and reproductive health services by Young Women &amp; Adolescent Girls  O1.1.2.2: The improved provision of gender -responsive, inclusive and accountable sexual and reproductive health services by health care providers for diverse groups of Young Women &amp; Adolescent Girls O1.1.2.3: The improved effectiveness of key stakeholders, led by women and girls&apos; rights organizations, to advocate for evidence -based health care policies, accountable legal framework, equitable and inclusive services</narrative>
  </description>
